      "body": "## Purpose\r\n\r\n`get_flash_attn_version()` logs an **ERROR** when the selected FlashAttention version is not supported:\r\n\r\n```\r\nERROR [fa_utils.py:212] Cannot use FA version 2 is not supported due to FA2 is only supported on devices with compute capability >= 8\r\n```\r\n\r\nOn pre-Ampere GPUs (e.g. Tesla T4, V100) this is an expected, handled case: the `AssertionError` is caught, `get_flash_attn_version()` returns `None`, and the run continues normally. However:\r\n\r\n1. It is logged at **ERROR** level, although nothing failed.\r\n2. It uses `logger.error` (not `*_once`), so it can repeat, e.g. once per worker in multi-GPU runs.\r\n3. The sentence is malformed (\"Cannot use FA version 2 is not supported due to ...\").\r\n\r\nThis makes successful runs look like failures and buries real errors among it:\r\n- #13766: a V100 user saw it and asked how to disable FlashAttention.\r\n- #29707: it is logged next to the actual failure (an unsupported quantization scheme), making the real cause harder to spot.\r\n- #22279: the same malformed sentence on an RTX 5090.\r\n\r\nThis PR logs it once as a warning with clearer wording, matching the other fallback messages in the same function, which already use `warning_once` / `info_once`. No behaviour change.\r\n\r\nNote: on newer GPUs, this message can also indicate a missing FlashAttention build. It stays visible as a warning; happy to keep ERROR for that case if maintainers prefer.\r\n\r\n## Test Plan\r\n\r\nTesla T4 (compute capability 7.5), Google Colab, `Qwen/Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct`, `dtype=\"half\"`: ran the same script before and after the change, compared the FlashAttention log lines, and checked that generation is unchanged. `pre-commit run --files vllm/v1/attention/backends/fa_utils.py` passes.\r\n\r\n## Test Result\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n```\r\n(EngineCore pid=6633) ERROR 10-25 16:09:59 [fa_utils.py:212] Cannot use FA version 2 is not supported due to FA2 is only supported on devices with compute capability >= 8\r\nGENERATED:  Paris. It is the largest city in\r\n```\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n```\r\n(EngineCore pid=11666) WARNING 10-25 16:17:16 [fa_utils.py:212] FlashAttention 2 is not supported (FA2 is only supported on devices with compute capability >= 8); it will not be used.\r\nGENERATED:  Paris. It is the largest city in\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n<a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/vllm-project/codesmith/vllm/pr/63592?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-light-v3.svg\"><img alt=\"View with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3-3x.png\" width=\"162\" height=\"28\"></picture></a> <a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1795538286&installation_model_id=425286&pr_number=63592&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=vllm-project%2Fvllm&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fvllm-project%2Fvllm%2Fpull%2F63592&signature=13f4a7973fc4865a0dbc057f80c835f9a3f7c7b071c559aeee44e983b15f6e37\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\r\n<sup>Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\r\n\r\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\r\n---\r\n<a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/vllm-project/codesmith/vllm/pr/63592?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-light-v3.svg\"><img alt=\"View with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3-3x.png\" width=\"162\" height=\"28\"></picture></a> <a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1795538296&installation_model_id=425286&pr_number=63592&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=vllm-project%2Fvllm&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fvllm-project%2Fvllm%2Fpull%2F63592&signature=f662b1b63ebc15bdf89a36f16c53a814a01b17ca17fd2aa47d1a0c09c8ef6252\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\r\n<sup>Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\r\n\r\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\r\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
